---
const title = "Sarcastic Headline Generator";
const description = "Can a character-level RNN learn sarcasm? I trained three architectures on The Onion to find out.";
const tags = ["RNN", "LSTM", "GRU", "NLP", "Text Generation", "Sarcasm"];
---

